        "datePublished": "2026-05-26",
        "name": "Wears well!!",
        "reviewBody": "I first purchased these more than ten years ago and am back for more. I\u2019ve used them in so many rooms and they still look great!  In my office, bathrooms, nursery, children\u2019s playrooms over the years, in different colors and lengths they\u2019ve helped brighten and beautify many spaces.  No, the screws aren\u2019t included but you can always save yourself a trip to the store and buy IKEA\u2019s screw set - it has a lot of the fasteners you\u2019ll need over time because you\u2019ll love these these!!",
        "reviewRating": {
