        },
        "datePublished": "2026-03-21",
        "name": "Picture ledge hack from As-is Department",
        "reviewBody": "Initially, I didn't know what this was when I found it in the As-is section. I purchased it along with three magnetic coat hangers and I installed the ledge upside down with the 3 coat hangers screwed on the face of it. Turned out great looking. I place small things on the very top since the ledge can still be used as a shelf, only its upside down. I didn't know it was a picture shelf until a week later when I was browsing through the art frames and spotted it there. I had a good chuckle.",
        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": 5
        }
      },
